This repository is a modified fork of FlowCast
(https://github.com/b-rbmp/FlowCast), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications in this fork include, among others:
  - an alternative STDiT-based denoiser and chunked autoregressive sampler
  - unbalanced optimal transport and quantile-weighted training objectives
  - additional datasets (CIKM2017, Shanghai2020, MeteoNet) and their loaders
  - evaluation, calibration and diagnostic tooling under tools/

The original Apache 2.0 LICENSE is retained unchanged.
